{"id": "70266", "title": "奢侈", "author": "折火一夏", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 25, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/70/70266/70266s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70266.htm", "intro": "长长的文案：\n    聂染青不清楚习进南为何要娶她，这个问题至今与UFO同属不明事物。习进南求婚的时候，她戳着桌子直视他，很认真很负责地提醒他：“你要想清楚，我不够好。”\n    但是习进南只是平平淡淡一笑，就像是以后无数次微笑一样的那种微笑，依旧托着那枚闪闪发亮的钻戒：“没有关系，够用就好。”\n    她只是沉默了十秒，就点头答应。\n    聂染青原来一直以为，陆沛就是她的未来，没有他她会活不下去。不过到后来她才发现，原来世上没有过不去的坎，成熟这东西，装着装着也就像模像样了。\n    什么见鬼的日久生情，一见钟情，那些过去的事永远不能媲美未来。\n    以后，才最重要。", "base": "files/article/html/70/70266", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "第 一 章", "file": "10914067.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 二 章", "file": "10914068.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 三 章", "file": "10914069.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 四 章", "file": "10914070.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 五 章", "file": "10914071.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 六 章", "file": "10914072.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 七 章", "file": "10914073.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 八 章", "file": "10914074.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 九 章", "file": "10914075.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 十 章", "file": "10914076.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 十一 章", "file": "10914077.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 十二 章", "file": "10914078.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 十三 章", "file": "10914079.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 十四 章", "file": "10914080.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第 十五 章", "file": "10914081.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第 十六 章", "file": "10914082.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第 十七 章", "file": "10914083.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第 十八 章", "file": "10914084.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第 十九 章", "file": "10914085.html", "available": true}, {"title": "20-25", "file": "10914086.html", "available": true}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "10914087.html", "available": true}, {"title": "31-35", "file": 